    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/online-education-classes/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Education Classes Theme is a modern and highly functional theme tailored for education-focused websites, online courses, virtual classrooms, e-learning platforms, tutoring centers, higher education institutions, training programs, universities, colleges, online coaching academies, skill development centers, and certification programs. Whether you’re building a platform for online learning, distance education, homeschooling, virtual training, or interactive classes, it offers all the tools needed to create a compelling and user-friendly portal. With its clean layout, responsive design, and intuitive navigation, it supports course creation, lesson planning, student assessment, and progress tracking through integration with the LearnPress, Tutor LMS, and Contact Form 7 plugins. Key features include online quizzes, academic calendars, virtual labs, video lectures, live classes via Zoom integration, multimedia content support such as webinars, eBooks, discussion forums, downloadable resources, and student dashboards. The theme also provides customizable banners, dedicated portals for students and teachers, tools to manage schedules, course enrollments, scholarship programs, and parent-teacher meetings. It’s SEO-friendly, translation-ready, and optimized for performance, ensuring a smooth user experience on all devices. Ideal for educators, tutors, training institutes, and e-learning businesses offering diverse learning programs, the Online Education Classes Theme provides a professional, engaging, and interactive solution for delivering quality education online."
    },
